'''Lione Hippoe''' (獅子カバブー, ''Shishi Kababū'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.1 Update|Version 2.1.1]].

