==Trivia==
*Lione Hippoe's Japanese name, Shishi Kababū (獅子カバブー), may be a pun combining ''shishi'' (獅子, "lion") and ''shishi kababu'' (シシカバブ), meaning "shish kebab"; the joke is that it also contains the word ''kaba'' (カバ), meaning "hippo".

